  "description": "Official .NET SDK for the ConnectWise PSA (Manage) REST API, version 2026.4. Provides strongly-typed clients (CompanyApi, TicketApi, TimeEntryApi, ProjectApi, OpportunityApi, …) and DTOs (Connectwise.Model.*) for the full ConnectWise PSA REST surface — service tickets, companies, contacts, agreements, projects, time entries, opportunities, invoices, configurations and 1800+ other endpoints. Repackaged unmodified from the official ConnectWise Developer Network distribution; ships per-TFM binaries for .NET Framework 4.8 and .NET Standard 2.1.",
